@startuml ig-evolution-lifecycle
!theme plain
title IG Evolution — Agile Draft Phase to HL7 Formal Process

|"Phase 1 — Agile Draft"|
start

:CI Build — Initial Draft;
note right
  FMM 0 — breaking changes
  expected and welcomed
end note

repeat
  :Agile iteration across SMART layers L1–L5;
  :Publish to /dev/ for stakeholder review;
  :Collect and incorporate feedback;
repeat while (Evaluation-ready?) is (no) not (yes)

:Tag draft release;

|"Transition — Readiness Gate"|
#FFF9C4:Assess readiness:\n• Semantic stability?\n• Pilot implementations?\n• Stakeholder consensus?\n• Clean CI build?;

|"Phase 2 — HL7 Formal Process"|

:Engage HL7 Work Group;

:Connectathon / interoperability test\n(≥ 3 independent systems — FMM 2);

:File Draft or STU Ballot;

repeat
  :Ballot cycle\n(collect comments → reconcile negatives);
  :STU publication (FMM 3–4);
  :Gather production implementation evidence;
repeat while (FMM 5 evidence reached?) is (no) not (yes)

:Normative Ballot (WG + FMG + TSC);
:Normative Publication — specification locked;

stop
@enduml
